      "text": "**[SCENE START]**\n\nA medium-low angle shot captures Mega Man standing firmly on a cracked, metallic platform amidst ruins overgrown with glowing cyan moss. Dust motes hang suspended in the warm air around him. He raises his right arm slightly, fist clenched, and offers a confident, determined grin. A distant, massive robotic silhouette looms over the background, partially obscured by smoke rising from shattered infrastructure.\n\n**[ACTION/DIALOGUE]**\nMega Man takes one deliberate step forward (a slight tracking shot follows this movement). His voice is bright and resolute: \"Alright, Robot Master! This time... you won't just *break* through!\" He punctuates the word 'break' by giving a quick, energetic pump of his left fist.\n\n**[CAMERA MOVEMENT]**\nThe camera slowly pushes in (slow zoom-in) on Mega Man’s face as he delivers the line, then widens slightly to capture his full heroic stance before settling into a steady medium shot for the next beat.\n\n**[LIGHTING & MOOD]**\nGolden hour sunlight streams in from the upper right, creating strong rim lighting around his blue armor and casting long, dramatic shadows across the cracked platform. The atmosphere is tense yet hopeful; shafts of light cut through swirling orange-tinged smoke.\n\n**[STYLISED AESTHETIC]**\nHigh-detail 3D animation style reminiscent of classic Capcom games, rendered with a vibrant, slightly painterly texture to enhance the retro feel.",
